OL,3,GNEWSAMum and son top bestseller list
OL,4,Awith Chinese recipes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then, they have amassed three
OL,7,Fmillion followers across TikTok and
OL,8,FYouTube and caught the eye of a major
OL,9,Fpublishing firm, prompting the release
OL,10,Fof The Ultimate Chinese Takeaway Bible.
OL,12,FIt became an instant Sunday Times
OL,13,Fbestseller and the pair now dream of
OL,14,Fhaving their own TV cooking show and a
OL,15,Fchain of fast-food outlets.
